# Copy this file to .env and put your real key. NEVER upload .env to GitHub.
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_key_here
# Model name: copy the exact ID from Google AI Studio if this one stops working
GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-3.5-flash
## Environment Configuration

CogniStream uses environment variables for model configuration and API access.

1. Copy `.env.example` to a local file named `.env`.
2. Add your own valid API key to the appropriate variable.
3. Set the model name to one supported by your application configuration.
4. Keep `.env` private and never commit it to GitHub.
5. Use placeholder values only in example configuration files.

### Security

Never publish API keys, passwords, or other secrets in source code, documentation, or public repositories.
